        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Small Talk Lesson Notes</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #202020;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 1.18;\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 17px 60px 38px;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    .corner {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 16px;\n      height: 16px;\n      border-color: #c7c7c7;\n      border-style: solid;\n    }\n    .tl { top: 1px; left: 44px; border-width: 0 1px 1px 0; }\n    .tr { top: 1px; right: 57px; border-width: 0 0 1px 1px; }\n    .bl { bottom: 4px; left: 44px; border-width: 1px 1px 0 0; }\n    .br { bottom: 4px; right: 57px; border-width: 1px 0 0 1px; }\n    p { margin: 0; }\n    .section-title {\n      margin-top: 2px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .underline { text-decoration: underline; }\n    .board-title {\n      margin-top: 1px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .blackboard {\n      width: 264px;\n      height: 109px;\n      margin: 5px 0 29px 1px;\n      border: 1px solid #777;\n      padding-top: 29px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      line-height: 1.95;\n    }\n    .blackboard strong {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n      font-size: 9px;\n    }\n    .chinese-title {\n      margin: 0 0 7px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", SimSun, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .transcript p { margin: 0; }\n    .transcript .label {\n      margin-top: 15px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .indent { padding-left: 18px; }\n    .annotation {\n      color: #9d3026;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", SimSun, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <i class=\"corner tl\"></i><i class=\"corner tr\"></i><i class=\"corner bl\"></i><i class=\"corner br\"></i>\n\n    <p>(2) Read the passage for the second time and answer some questions.</p>\n    <p class=\"underline\">Q1:What's the small talk?</p>\n    <p>It's a common form of communication.</p>\n    <p class=\"underline\">Q2:What's the important thing of the small talk?</p>\n    <p>It is important to keep the conversation light and humorous.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"section-title\">Step 4:Post-reading</p>\n    <p>Role play: suppose that you are in a new class. And please make a small<br>talk with your classmates.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"section-title\">Step 5:Summary and homework</p>\n    <p>Summary: Make a summary with the whole class.</p>\n    <p>Homework: Finish the exercises on the book and share what we have<br>learned with your parents.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"board-title\">5.Blackboard design</p>\n    <div class=\"blackboard\">\n      <strong>Small talk</strong>\n      <div>Q1: What's the small talk?</div>\n      <div>Q2:What's the important thing about small talk?</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h1 class=\"chinese-title\">逐字稿</h1>\n\n    <section class=\"transcript\">\n      <p><strong>Greeting:</strong>&nbsp; <span class=\"underline\">Hello, everyone, nice to see you again. How was everything</span></p>\n      <p class=\"underline\">going? That's not bad? I'm so glad to hear that.</p>\n\n      <p class=\"label\">Warm up:</p>\n      <p class=\"underline\">How about singing a song to cheer you up? &lt;We are the world.&gt;</p>\n      <p><em>We are the world, we are the children. We are the ones who make a<br>brighter day. So let's start giving.</em></p>\n      <p class=\"underline\">OK, are you happy now? It's time for class.</p>\n\n      <p class=\"label\">Lead-in:</p>\n      <p class=\"indent\">I watched a very interesting video and now I want to share it with<br>you.<span class=\"annotation\">(视频声?)</span> Do you want to see it? Well, let's look at the PPT. <span class=\"annotation\">(手指屏幕)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"indent underline\">What can you see in the video?</p>\n      <p class=\"indent underline\">Yes, some people. Who are they? Yes, they are some businessmen.</p>\n      <p class=\"underline\">What are they doing? Right, they are chatting with one another before<br>having a meeting, and the topic they are talking about is very funny, so the<br>atmosphere is relaxing, right? We call it small talk. Do you know why they<br>do so before such an important and serious meeting?<span class=\"annotation\">(互动，引导学生思考)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"indent\">Well, today we will learn something about this. We will learn <span class=\"underline\">small</span><br><span class=\"underline\">talk.</span><span class=\"annotation\">(板书标题)</span></p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
